<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10171] Running queries descriptor (GridRunningQueryInfo) contains generated SQL text instead of original SQL text</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10171</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Running queries descriptors (&lt;tt&gt;GridRunningQueryInfo&lt;/tt&gt;) for SQL queries received by &lt;tt&gt;GridQueryProcessor#runningQueries()&lt;/tt&gt; method contains SQL text generated from parsed query structure. For diagnostic purposes it&apos;s better to store original SQL query text instaed.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
